5 = "<img src=`"images/image9.png`" alt=`"official answer`">" + (WHY "Eyes reaction = <b>acknowledged, draft PR coming</b> · timeline shows Copilot started = <b>session actively running</b> · checks not running = <b>a human must manually approve and run workflows</b>.")
